{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19021","headline":"酬令狐相公季冬南郊宿斋见寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬令狐相公季冬南郊宿斋见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"坛下雪初霁，南城冻欲生。\n斋心祠上帝，高步领名卿。\n沐浴含芳泽，周旋听佩声。\n犹怜广平守，寂寞竟何成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19021.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19021","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}